note one method of the class: selector text, callback entry, type text
fn umethod c ulong t view uchar * entry ulong ty view uchar * to bool
s = usl t
n = ucs ty
upr 0 c
upr 8 s
upr 16 ulong libfn int add 2 entry
upr 24 ulong libptr g_nm 0 1024
ret eq and ucall 5 255 1
end

